  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "At Lang Ya blessed land, the land spirit tells Fang Yuan that starlight fireflies are extinct in the mortal realm, then recalls recently seeing a swarm in treasure yellow heaven that he thinks belongs to Star Lord Wan Xiang.",
      "chapters": [
        462
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_lang_ya_blessed_land",
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A ray of starlight transforms into a middle-aged man. He wears a long robe with wide sleeves and a high hat.",
      "chapters": [
        716
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "When the seal ends, his body lets out bright starlight.",
      "chapters": [
        728
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "seal-ends",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "When Fang Yuan later trades through connecting heaven Gu, Little Hu Immortal names Starlord Wan Xiang as the merchant selling starlight firefly Gu. An early remnant recipe exchange already brings Fang Yuan a swarm of starlight fireflies and two immortal essence stones from him; under bidding with Fairy Yao Guang and Di Yuan, Wan Xiang’s batch shows the strongest treasure light because many starlight firefly Gu sit mixed in the ordinary fireflies. Fang Yuan then recalls that after stargate Gu appears, Starlord Wan Xiang moves quickly and earns a large amount of immortal essence stones by selling starlight firefly Gu.",
      "chapters": [
        466
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "treasure-yellow-heaven-trade",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_little_hu_immortal",
        "char_fairy_yao_guang",
        "char_di_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The same trade stretch also has Wan Xiang offer star fragment grass farming knowledge, with his document praised for innovative ideas.",
      "chapters": [
        467
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "treasure-yellow-heaven-trade",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "In Earth Abyss, Hei Lou Lan places Star Lord Wan Xiang’s corpse; once the seal ends, starlight bursts from the body, earth qi gathers, and a starlight door labeled Star Form Blessed Land forms. Inside, Star Form Child, formed from Wan Xiang’s lingering obsession, says the main body was heavily injured by Song Zi Xing and perished in the eighth star hall, and demands Song Zi Xing’s head as the condition for a new owner.",
      "chapters": [
        728
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "death-and-star-form-blessed-land",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_earth_earth_abyss",
        "char_hei_lou_lan",
        "loc_star_form_blessed_land",
        "char_star_form_child",
        "char_song_zi_xing"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Later inspection of Star Form blessed land states that Star Lord Wan Xiang had rank six cultivation with one heavenly tribulation passed, was a lone cultivator, and mainly sold star dart Gu, stellar fire Gu, falling meteor Gu, star river Gu, and starlight firefly Gu from four revenue areas. He had discovered a yearly spatial crack from Starry Sky grotto-heaven into Central Continent, scavenged there repeatedly, and built a foundation Shi Lei judged on par with typical rank six Gu Immortals of the ten great ancient sects, until Song Zi Xing’s injuries and an impending tribulation forced a joint exploration in which Wan Xiang’s soul was destroyed in Star Constellation Immortal Venerable’s dream realm in the eighth star hall.",
      "chapters": [
        851
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "rank-and-foundation",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_star_dart_gu",
        "loc_starry_sky_grotto_heaven",
        "reg_central_continent",
        "char_shi_lei",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "char_star_constellation_immortal_venerable"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He left three Immortal Gu in the blessed land, Star Mark, Starlight, and Star Shoot, after a fourth Immortal Gu was destroyed in the fight with Song Zi Xing, plus a star path inheritance that first raised him to rank six and the Starry Sky grotto-heaven entrance as his second fortuitous encounter.",
      "chapters": [
        852
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "rank-and-foundation",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    }
  ],
